{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A psalm. YHWH, who shall sojourn in Your tent</b> — Your house. And like it: <i>each man to your tent, O Israel</i>." "<b>In Your holy mountain</b> — Mount Moriah or Mount Zion, before it is known that it is Mount Moriah, when the Ark dwelt in Zion, in the house that David prepared for it, as written in Chronicles."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:16.786631909Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}